# "Whenever one or more creatures your opponents control are dealt excess noncombat damage": damage dealt together is one
# event (CR 603.2c, the card's ruling), so it triggers once however many creatures were dealt excess. On turn 3 the Galleon
# kills one of Bot2's three Ornithopters (a Treasure, 3 excess); on turn 5 Anger of the Gods deals 3 to the other two at once,
# 1 excess each: one more Treasure, not two.
